.
.  Generate sample output for F PDF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na fpdf.jpg
device 2 gd jpeg
device 2 picture points 100 75
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE F PDF (5, 3 df)
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
Y1LABEL Probability Density
X1LABEL X
.
PLOT FPDF(X,5,3) FOR X = 0 0.01 10
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv fpdf.jpg ../gif100/fpdf.jpg
.
quit
